{
  "episodeId": "CH01_EP03",
  "name": "饭桌以后",
  "startNode": "CH01_EP03_N001",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_N001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ANRAN",
      "text": "吃饭的时候能不能别看手机？",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_N002"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_N002",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ZHOUMAN",
      "text": "我就看一眼。",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_N003"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_N003",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ZHOUMAN",
      "text": "爸，如果一个人一直不回消息，是不是就是不想回？",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_C001"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_C001",
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "可能只是忙。",
          "effects": {
            "avoidance": 1
          },
          "setFlags": [
            "TOLD_DAUGHTER_MAYBE_BUSY"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP03_A001"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "你可以直接问他。",
          "effects": {
            "honesty": 2,
            "selfReflection": 1
          },
          "setFlags": [
            "ADVISED_DIRECT_QUESTION"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP03_B001"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "别一直等。",
          "effects": {
            "reality": 2
          },
          "setFlags": [
            "ADVISED_NOT_TO_WAIT"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP03_C001A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_A001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ZHOUMAN",
      "text": "大人是不是特别喜欢说别人忙？",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_N004"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_B001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ZHOUMAN",
      "text": "那多尴尬。",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_N004"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_C001A",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ZHOUMAN",
      "text": "说得轻松。",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_N004"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_N004",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个很久以前的声音突然从记忆里冒出来：你生气能不能直接说？",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_N005"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_N005",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深夜23:18，那个纸箱还在桌上。信封被单独放在了台灯下面。",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_COND001"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_COND001",
      "type": "condition",
      "branches": [
        {
          "flag": "TOLD_PARTNER_XIA",
          "equals": true,
          "next": "CH01_EP03_N006A"
        }
      ],
      "fallback": "CH01_EP03_N006B"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_N006A",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ANRAN",
      "text": "想看就看。",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_C002"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_N006B",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ANRAN",
      "text": "别太晚。",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_C002"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_C002",
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "打开信。",
          "setFlags": [
            "READ_LETTER_OPENING"
          ],
          "effects": {
            "nostalgia": 3,
            "regret": 2
          },
          "next": "CH01_EP03_LETTER_001"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "先看看MP3。",
          "setFlags": [
            "FOUND_MP3"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP03_MP3_001"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "再看看那张照片。",
          "effects": {
            "nostalgia": 1
          },
          "next": "CH01_EP03_PHOTO_001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_LETTER_001",
      "type": "letter",
      "text": "周叙：不知道你看到这封信的时候，已经多少岁了。如果真的已经过去很多年……那大概说明，我们最后没有一起走到未来。",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_TO_MP3",
      "actionText": "抽出信纸"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_PHOTO_001",
      "type": "photo",
      "text": "周叙重新看着照片。二十八年前的许知夏还停在树下。",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_TO_MP3",
      "backText": "照片背面写着：2009.6，南门那棵树。周叙拍照的时候能不能看镜头。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_MP3_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周叙找到一根还能使用的旧转接线，把MP3接上了电源。",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_TO_MP3"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_TO_MP3",
      "type": "narration",
      "next": "CH01_EP03_END",
      "text": "他把转接线接好，MP3屏幕亮了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_END",
      "type": "episodeEnd",
      "next": "CH01_EP04"
    }
  ]
}
